<title>BELARUS: Belarus unemployment rate rises to 3.8 pct in Aug.</title>
<headline>Belarus unemployment rate rises to 3.8 pct in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of Belarus's officially recorded unemployed rose in August to 3.8 percent of the workforce from 3.24 percent in July, the Statistics Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    BELARUS UNEMPLOYMENT     Aug '96   July '96   Aug '95</p>
<p>    Number unemployed	  183,400   180,400    118,500</p>
<p>    As pct of the workforce    3.8	 3.24	 2.5</p>
<p>--Larisa Sayenko, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
